#-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# STM32H5 Series Chip Variant Selection
#-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This file defines chip variants for STM32H5 series.
# TODO: Add specific chip variants (H503, H523, H533, H562, H563, H573)
